    "title": "Gonzaga vs Texas schedule, TV channel, how to watch March Madness game",
    "text": "Updated March 20, 2026, 9:47 a.m. MTNo. 11 seed Texas and No. 3 seed Gonzaga play in a March Madness NCAA Tournament men's college basketball game on Saturday, March 21.Here's what to know about the time, TV channel, streaming information and announcers for the West Region March Madness second-round game.Texas defeated No. 6 seed BYU in the first round of the NCAA Tournament, 79-71.Gonzaga beat No. 14 seed Kennesaw State in the Round of 64 of March Madness, 73-64.The winner of this game will advance to the Sweet 16 of the NCAA Tournament.How to watch March Madness: Michigan vs Saint Louis | Michigan State vs Louisville | Duke vs TCU | Houston vs Texas A&M | Gonzaga vs Texas | Illinois vs VCU | Nebraska vs Vanderbilt | Arkansas vs High Point | Second-round game schedule, TV channelsWatch Gonzaga vs Texas on Sling TVWhat time is the Texas vs Gonzaga March Madness game?The Gonzaga vs Texas NCAA Tournament March Madness second-round game is scheduled for 4:10 p.m. MST on Saturday, March 21.Join the madness: USA TODAY Bracket Challenge | Survivor Pool | Printable bracket | Your picks vs expertsWhat channel is the Gonzaga vs Texas March Madness game on?The Texas vs Gonzaga Round of 32 March Madness NCAA Tournament game can be seen on TBS and truTV.March Madness picks: Michigan vs Saint Louis | Michigan State vs Louisville | Duke vs TCU | Houston vs Texas A&M | Gonzaga vs Texas | Illinois vs VCU | Nebraska vs Vanderbilt | Arkansas vs High Point | Second-round score predictionsHow can I stream the Texas vs Gonzaga March Madness game?Gonzaga vs Texas can be streamed on Sling TV and other streaming services that carry TBS and truTV.Who are the announcers for the Gonzaga vs Texas March Madness game?Brad Nessler will have the play-by-play call of the Texas Longhorns vs Gonzaga Bulldogs NCAA Tournament Round of 32 game, with Wally Szczerbiak as the analyst and Jared Greenberg as the reporter for the March Madness second-round matchup.March Madness odds: Michigan vs Saint Louis | Michigan State vs Louisville | Duke vs TCU | Houston vs Texas A&M | Gonzaga vs Texas | Illinois vs VCU | Nebraska vs Vanderbilt | Arkansas vs High Point | Second-round game oddsReach Jeremy Cluff at jeremy.cluff@arizonarepublic.com. Follow him on X, formerly Twitter @Jeremy_Cluff.Support local journalism: Subscribe to azcentral.com today. Sign up for azcentral Preps Now. And be sure to subscribe to our daily sports newsletters so you don't miss a thing.Our team of savvy editors independently handpicks all recommendations. If you purchase through our links, the USA TODAY Network may earn a commission. Prices were accurate at the time of publication but may change.",
